msgctxt "260"
msgid "Dammit... There's gotta be somebody here I can hire for a bodyguard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "You're still here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"I'm so scared, I can't even move. You've gotta be my bodyguard, man! I'll "
"pay you good for it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Just take me to the nearest taxi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I'm busy. You'll have to take care of it yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Dammit... What am I supposed to do now!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Before I answer, how about you show me that lucky ticket of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Well, for you I guess it's okay. Here it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "The date's not right. This thing is from a month ago. Take a look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "What the hell is this!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "You mean... I didn't actually win the 300,000,000 big ones...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Sure seems that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Aaah... Well, I'll be damned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"But you know what, I actually feel a huge sense of relief. I was going a "
"bit crazy when I thought I'd had all that money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Good thing I found out before I quit my job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Money makes me sick. I mean, I was acting like a raving lunatic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"I imagine most people would go a little cuckoo if they thought they'd won "
"that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Sorry for putting you through all that drama. I can't even look at money "
"right now. Please, take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "You sure about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Positive. I'm gonna walk home tonight and cool off in the fresh night "
"air... So long, buddy."
msgstr ""

